                                "sense_id": "d4f1ae49-3541-3a90-8ebc-dfc3967528ab",
                                "text": "The Sun ſhall change, the Moon to change ſhall ceaſe;\nThe Gaits to clim-----the Sheep to yield the Fleece,\nEre ought by me be either ſaid or done,\nShall do thee Wrang, I ſwear by all aboon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f32dc731-95e2-4a22-86cb-f7eb05950246",
                                "sense_id": "d4f1ae49-3541-3a90-8ebc-dfc3967528ab",
                                "text": "We'll a' meet aboon! We'll a' meet aboon!\nOh what a blithe meeting yon meeting aboon!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
